blocks.en:
Our pipeline (Fig. 2 ) has three stages:
(1) extract a motion signal M t M_{t} and an audio signal E t E_{t} ;
(2) fuse them into an evidence score A t A_{t} ;
(3) select K K frames using an Information Compression (IC) operator
that enforces both high evidence and temporal diversity.

blocks.zh:
我们的管道(图2)有三个阶段:
(1) 提取一个运动信号Mt M_{t}和一个音频信号E t E_{t};
(2) 将它们装入证据分数A t A_{t};
(3) 使用信息压缩( IC) 运算符选择 KK 帧
既执行高证据,又执行时间多样性。

我们放弃四种设计选择:(一) 方式和聚变重量;
(二) 信息压缩漏洞\tau;
(四)运动通道后面的光学流量估计器.
除非另有说明,所有涂料均使用K=2K=2的UCF-Crime。

blocks.en:
UCF: a crime being committed; an anomalous event; fighting or
assault; robbery or burglary; arson or a fire; a road accident;
shoplifting or stealing; vandalism.

